<title>USA: General Chemical Q3 shr $0.63 vs $0.64.</title>
<headline>General Chemical Q3 shr $0.63 vs $0.64.</headline>
<dateline>HAMPTON, N.H. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>					   September 30,  September 30,</p>
<p>					     1996    1995   1996   1995</p>
<p> Sales				    $162.0 $142.5 $466.7 $414.2</p>
<p> Cost of Sales			   110.2   97.3  320.4  288.4</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>  administrative expenses (A)	 14.7   14.5   56.2   41.5</p>
<p> Income from operations		 37.1   30.7   90.1   84.3</p>
<p> Minority Interest			 8.3    5.7   23.0   14.9</p>
<p> Interest and other expense, net     5.0    5.0   16.7   16.2</p>
<p> Income before income taxes	   23.8   20.0   50.4   53.2</p>
<p> Income tax expense			9.2    7.4   19.4   19.9</p>
<p> Net income (A)			   14.6   12.6   31.0   33.3</p>
<p> Net earnings per common share (A)  0.63   0.64   1.44   1.69</p>
<p>Weighted average common shares</p>
<p>  outstanding (B)			 23.2   19.7   21.5   19.7</p>
<p>NOTES:</p>
<p>(A) The nine months ended September 30, 1996 includes $12.5 million ($7.6 million after-tax or $0.35 per share) of nonrecurring charges recorded in the second quarter of 1996, in conjunction with the initial public offering related primarily to management incentive programs.</p>
<p>(B) Includes weighted average common stock equivalent shares for 1996 related to restricted stock programs and stock options.</p>
<p>Full company name is General Chemical Group Inc.</p>
<p>(In Millions, Except Per Share Amounts)</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
